sequenceDiagram
  participant E as effect（如组件渲染函数）
  participant P as Proxy.get
  participant D as Dep（targetMap）
  participant S as Proxy.set
  E->>P: 读 state.count
  P->>D: track(target, key)
  Note over D: dep.linkSub(activeSub)<br/>dep ↔ 订阅者 双向关联
  P-->>E: 返回属性值
  Note over E,P: 依赖收集完成
  S->>S: 写 state.count = 2
  S->>D: trigger(target, key)
  D->>E: sub.notify()
  E->>E: 重新执行，同时收集新依赖
